كتابي أنا (Kitabi Ana)
======================

This repository was separated from a repository it shared with another
project. All code, data and tests specific to that other project were removed.
Part of the remaining code originates from the shared repository:

- packages/core (types, http, server, safety, content, story, illustrations)
- supabase (content and request-quota schema, edge function)
- scripts, tests, CI workflow and Playwright configuration

Original authorship is recorded in the history of the shared repository.
See docs/ORIGIN.md.

